# Baked content is GENERATED by fw-content-baker, not committed by hand.
# Reviewed bakes land in content/baked/ via a tracked manifest.ron + per-file
# RON drops; the RON itself is gitignored at T0 because:
#   1. The baker doesn't exist yet (lands at T2-3).
#   2. We want to make the bake-time/runtime split structural — a stray
#      hand-edit to content/baked/ would silently desync from the manifest's
#      prompt_hash audit trail.
#
# Once T2-3 lands, this .gitignore is replaced by an explicit allowlist of
# baked artifacts (so reviewable diffs land in PRs); the manifest.ron is
# always tracked.

*.ron
*.tracery.json
!manifest.ron
!.gitkeep
